= Research

== Research Overview
My research focuses on AI for AI (AI4AI), world models, and learning theory - building learning systems that can design, improve, and understand themselves, while remaining grounded in statistical and structural principles.

== Current Interests
- AI4AI
- World models
- Learning theory

